    "type": "game",
    "name": "Heroes Of Isekai",
    "steam_appid": 2676290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHeroes Of Isekai\u300bis a roguelike auto-battler where you choose a hero, build an army, and strategize for battle. Develop your hero, manage a town, allocate resources, upgrade units, and recruit diverse races. Each hero has unique lore, skills, and talents, offering distinct strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Hero</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/f2be1d5eee5847476ddc649ab0c6ab90.avif?t=1745246768\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We offer a variety of heroes, each with unique skills that drastically alter gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Races &amp; Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2d822d9706f40eb5694866e25a5d2802.avif?t=1745246768\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes, Goblins, Beasts, and more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camp - Purchase &amp; Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/df53623873a677b24c267e97e830d652.avif?t=1745246768\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized pools offer buildings, spells, runes, and units. Spend gold each round to shape your hero and army\u2014choose your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Buildings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/778a8cb3201d0e9b6629e53f9360051a.avif?t=1745246768\" width=554 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Structures with special effects: amplify magic, forge hero gear, enhance unit stats, and more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend mana to cast spells\u2014water, fire, earth, or wind, tiered from basic to advanced. Unleash lightning strikes, empower troops, or freeze enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up to boost stats\u2014time to go god-mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rune System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/25835ccc1a684a0cb14a4de9b83335f8.avif?t=1745246768\" width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip runes for multi-dimensional upgrades, a core build mechanic. Some grant instant bonuses; powerful ones require conditions to activate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/3c8fdef5c0ce2e11c512d7cd0b696a01.avif?t=1745246768\" width=792 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three core paths:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Army:</strong> Invest in units and runes. Hero talents/passives buff your forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic:</strong> Focus on spell-related buildings, runes, and gear. Talents amplify magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legend:</strong> Pour gold into smithing and power runes. Craft epic gear\u2014hero skills supercharge it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Perilous Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick 1 of 3 nodes per move. Weigh risks vs rewards\u2014deeper zones bring tougher foes but greater loot. Push forward... until you face the Abyss Legion.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHeroes Of Isekai\u300bis a roguelike auto-battler where you choose a hero, build an army, and strategize for battle. Develop your hero, manage a town, allocate resources, upgrade units, and recruit diverse races. Each hero has unique lore, skills, and talents, offering distinct strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Hero</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/f2be1d5eee5847476ddc649ab0c6ab90.avif?t=1745246768\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We offer a variety of heroes, each with unique skills that drastically alter gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Races &amp; Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2d822d9706f40eb5694866e25a5d2802.avif?t=1745246768\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes, Goblins, Beasts, and more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camp - Purchase &amp; Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/df53623873a677b24c267e97e830d652.avif?t=1745246768\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized pools offer buildings, spells, runes, and units. Spend gold each round to shape your hero and army\u2014choose your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Buildings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/778a8cb3201d0e9b6629e53f9360051a.avif?t=1745246768\" width=554 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Structures with special effects: amplify magic, forge hero gear, enhance unit stats, and more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend mana to cast spells\u2014water, fire, earth, or wind, tiered from basic to advanced. Unleash lightning strikes, empower troops, or freeze enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up to boost stats\u2014time to go god-mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rune System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/25835ccc1a684a0cb14a4de9b83335f8.avif?t=1745246768\" width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip runes for multi-dimensional upgrades, a core build mechanic. Some grant instant bonuses; powerful ones require conditions to activate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/3c8fdef5c0ce2e11c512d7cd0b696a01.avif?t=1745246768\" width=792 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three core paths:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Army:</strong> Invest in units and runes. Hero talents/passives buff your forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic:</strong> Focus on spell-related buildings, runes, and gear. Talents amplify magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legend:</strong> Pour gold into smithing and power runes. Craft epic gear\u2014hero skills supercharge it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Perilous Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick 1 of 3 nodes per move. Weigh risks vs rewards\u2014deeper zones bring tougher foes but greater loot. Push forward... until you face the Abyss Legion.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Heroes Of Isekai&quot; is a strategy game blending roguelike, auto-chess, and tactical combat. Choose a hero, build an army with unique units, spells, and gear, and defeat the Abyss Legion. Each hero and race offers distinct playstyles\u2014victory demands both brains and bravery!",
